
<section style="min-height: 60vh; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; background:hsl(var(--accent)); color:hsl(var(--butter)); padding:3rem 0; text-align:center;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 780px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 5rem); color:hsl(var(--butter)); margin-bottom: 1rem;">You're not background.</h1>
    <p style="font-size:1.2rem; color:hsl(var(--butter)); opacity:0.95;">When you feel good in the details, you become the main scene.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section-pad" style="padding:5rem 0;">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
    <p style="font-size:1.2rem; line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:2rem;">Chinchoo isn't here to make you louder. It's here to make you feel finished — fast. Real style happens in the small moments, and the right details change how you show up.</p>
    <div style="aspect-ratio:16/9; overflow:hidden; border-radius:1.75rem; margin-bottom:2rem;">
      <img src="{{ 'lifestyle-1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Chinchoo lifestyle" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
    </div>
    <h2 style="font-size:2rem; margin-bottom:1rem;">A friend in your fashion journey</h2>
    <p style="line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1rem;">Life is coffee runs, late mornings, quick mirror checks, and plans that weren't planned. Chinchoo was created for those moments — so you can feel present, put-together, and like yourself without overcomplicating style.</p>
    <p style="line-height:1.8; margin-bottom:1rem;">We believe in elevated, expressive essentials that feel alive — premium without intimidation, playful without losing polish. The kind of details that don't need announcing, but get noticed anyway.</p>
    <p style="line-height:1.8;">Today, that starts with nails. Tomorrow, it's everything that helps you feel like you.</p>
  </div>
</section>
